// Records demos/probe-dbfar.dm3 on zoo: a creeper (its AI off, so it stands where it is,
// and its health raised so it lives) 70 units ahead of Julie is hurt by the fire sword six
// times, so it catches fire (half of the hits light it, Sentient::TryLightOnFire), then she
// walks backwards for 7 s while it burns, for how the sound of a burning creature
// (fx_catchfire.tik's flame2.wav loops) falls away with distance. Play it with the
// retail-demo skill's sound mode.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 3
stuffcmd "set g_syncronousClients 1"
spawn creeper.tik origin "-2282 1568 0" angles "0 180 0" targetname "cr1"
wait 0.2
$cr1 health 3000
$cr1 ai_off
wait 1
stuffcmd "record probe-dbfar"
wait 0.5
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 0.3
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 0.3
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 0.3
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 0.3
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 0.3
$cr1 hurt 1 firesword
wait 2
stuffcmd "+back"
wait 7
stuffcmd "-back"
wait 3
stuffcmd "stoprecord"
wait 0.2
stuffcmd "quit"
end
